{"id": "1972138", "name": "חישוב סכום של טור 1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; direction: ltr;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; direction: rtl;\">מצאו את סכום הטור&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">\\[&nbsp; \\displaystyle{\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} {\\frac{1}{({{CT:0}})({{CT:1}})}} = }\\]</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">&nbsp;[[input:ans1]][[validation:ans1]]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\"></span></p><p>עבור אינסוף יש לרשום inf&nbsp;עבור מינוס אינסוף יש לרשום minf</p><p><br>\n\n</p><br><p></p>", "generalfeedback": "<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><h4 style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\">פתרון:</h4><p>נסו לפשט בצורה הבאה:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\">\\[ \\frac{1}{({{CT:0}})\\cdot({{CT:1}})} = \\frac{1}{{CT:2}} - \\frac{1}{{CT:3}} \\]</p><p style=\"direction: rtl;\">מכאן, למה שווה:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\">&nbsp;\\[&nbsp; \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} {\\frac{1}{({{CT:0}})\\cdot({{CT:1}})}} =&nbsp; &nbsp;\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{{{CT:4}}}\\left(\\frac{1}{{CT:0}} - \\frac{1}{{CT:1}}\\right)&nbsp; = ? \\]<br></p><p style=\"direction: ltr; \"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left; direction: ltr;\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p></p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1",